  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/aTDKUnn.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1126\" height=\"689\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/teamfrostmods/Tougher-Glass-Fabric/blob/master/LICENSE\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/license/CodersLabs/Tougher-Glass-Fabric?style=for-the-badge&color=AEE717&labelColor=6FD60D\" alt=\"\" width=\"153\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/DYQezrEvXx\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/820002902708846622?label=&logo=discord&color=AEE717&labelColor=6FD60D&logoColor=white&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\"></a><a href=\"https://github.com/CodersLabs/Tougher-Glass-Fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Source Code&color=AEE717&labelColor=6FD60D&style=for-the-badge&logo=github\" alt=\"\" width=\"147\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/tougher-glass-connected-ctm\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=CTM&message=Tougher Glass&color=AEE717&labelColor=6FD60D&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\" width=\"181\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tougher-glass-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=Forge&message=Tougher Glass&color=FF9000&labelColor=FFC277&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">Tougher Glass&nbsp;добавляет стекло с взрывоустойчивостью обсидиана во всех цветах Minecraft.</span></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">Благодарности:</span></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif\">ffrannny,&nbsp;за мексиканский&nbsp;перевод</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://is.gd/FabricApi\" width=\"209\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p><br>Ферма, которую вы можете построить:<br><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/zGoBI14PUyE?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>",
